      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Features:</li><li> Attractive, well-appointed and spacious 4 bedroom semi-detached house.</li><li> Energy efficient home with a A3 BER.</li><li> Quiet exclusive cul-de-sac location in a small development with an amenity green and children's play area.</li><li> Excellent location within short stroll of the Dart and Shankill Village.</li><li> Close to the Luas at Cherrywood, a choice of Dublin Bus services stop within 50m of the development and N11/M11/M50 interchange.</li><li> Immaculate interiors, bespoke fully fitted kitchen, elegant bathroom suites.</li><li> Superb principal bedroom suite with a walk in wardrobe, ensuite bathroom, study and private terrace.</li><li> Four bedrooms all with built in wardrobes, two ensuite.</li><li> Mix of Oak engineered wooden floors and tiled floors throughout with quality carpets on the landing and stairs, </li><li> Integrated appliances in the kitchen are included.</li><li> Plenty of storage throughout the property.</li><li></li><li>Services:</li><li> Gas Fired Central heating.</li><li> Usual mains water and sewerage.</li><li> Usual TV, phone and broadband services are available.</ul>"
